// NOVA ORCHESTRATOR — Pure NovaLang, Zero Python
// =================================================================
// Replaces core/orchestrator.py (8228 lines Python) with pure
// NovaLang using N-S ternary flow architecture.
//
// Reynolds routing: Re = density * velocity * length / viscosity
//   Re < 27  = laminar  (direct route, no cascade)
//   Re < 343 = transitional (cascade with backoff)
//   Re > 343 = turbulent (full swarm dispatch)
//
// Port: 9999
// =================================================================

